<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Page not found - Riyasewana.com</title>
<!-- noindex, not "all": this page is served for every dead URL on the site and
     must never end up in search results. The 404 status usually prevents that on
     its own, but the previous "all" was actively asking for the opposite. -->
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />
<link rel="shortcut icon" href="https://riyasewana.com/favicon.ico" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="https://riyasewana.com/favicon-32x32.png" />
<!-- Deliberately self-contained: ErrorDocument fires for every bad URL including
     the scraper traffic the rate limiter already fights, so this page runs no PHP,
     opens no database connection and loads no external stylesheet. -->
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:'Open Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;background:#f0f2f5;color:#1a1a2e;line-height:1.5}
a{text-decoration:none}
.hdr{background:#039BE6;padding:14px 16px;text-align:center}
.hdr img{height:34px;vertical-align:middle}
.wrap{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 16px 44px}
.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:26px 22px;text-align:center}
h1{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 10px;color:#1a1a2e}
.lead{font-size:15px;color:#555;margin:0 0 6px}
.hint{font-size:13.5px;color:#777;margin:0}
.cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:20px;background:#2F855A;color:#fff;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;padding:12px 30px;border-radius:8px}
.sec{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#555;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin:30px 0 12px;text-align:center}
.cats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px}
.cats a{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:9px;padding:14px 8px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#1a1a2e}
.cats a:hover{border-color:#039BE6;color:#039BE6}
.foot{text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:#777;margin-top:28px;line-height:1.9}
.foot a{color:#039BE6}
.foot .sep{color:#ccc;margin:0 7px}
@media(max-width:640px){
  .wrap{padding:18px 12px 34px}
  .card{padding:22px 16px}
  h1{font-size:19px}
  /* Four across is unreadable on a phone; two keeps the labels legible and the
     tap targets big enough. */
  .cats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px}
  .cats a{padding:15px 8px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="hdr">
  <a href="https://riyasewana.com"><img src="https://riyasewana.com/images/logo.svg" alt="Riyasewana" /></a>
</div>

<div class="wrap">

  <div class="card">
    <h1>This page isn't here</h1>
    <!-- Most 404s on a classifieds site are a sold or deleted ad reached from an
         old WhatsApp, Facebook or search-engine link, so the message names that
         cause instead of the generic "page does not exist". -->
    <p class="lead">If you followed a link to a vehicle, the ad has most likely been sold or removed by the seller.</p>
    <p class="hint">Thousands of other vehicles are listed right now.</p>
    <a class="cta" href="https://riyasewana.com/search">Browse all vehicles</a>
  </div>

  <div class="sec">Or jump straight to</div>
  <div class="cats">
    <a href="https://riyasewana.com/search/cars">Cars</a>
    <a href="https://riyasewana.com/search/suvs">SUVs</a>
    <a href="https://riyasewana.com/search/vans">Vans</a>
    <a href="https://riyasewana.com/search/motorcycles">Motorbikes</a>
    <a href="https://riyasewana.com/search/lorries">Lorries</a>
    <a href="https://riyasewana.com/search/three-wheels">Three Wheels</a>
    <a href="https://riyasewana.com/search/pickups">Pickups</a>
    <a href="https://riyasewana.com/spare-parts-accessories.php">Spare Parts</a>
  </div>

  <div class="foot">
    <a href="https://riyasewana.com">Home</a><span class="sep">&middot;</span>
    <a href="https://riyasewana.com/register.php">Post Free Ad</a><span class="sep">&middot;</span>
    <a href="https://riyasewana.com/account.php">My Account</a><span class="sep">&middot;</span>
    <a href="https://riyasewana.com/reach-us.php">Contact Us</a>
    <div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;color:#999">Riyasewana.com &mdash; Sri Lanka's largest vehicle marketplace</div>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
